annotator

The on-disk comment format and the code under src/format/ (types, escaping, id generation,
parsing, serialization and the pure edit operations) are a Rust port of markedit-comments
(https://codebahn.net/g/markedit-comments, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Gianluca Brindisi), whose
format code is itself ported from the Obsidian "Document Comments" plugin:

  https://github.com/kylemcd/obsidian-document-comments
  Copyright (c) 2026 Kyle McDonald
  Licensed under the MIT License

Parts of the web UI (web/src/ui/) are adapted from markedit-comments.

The port keeps the format byte-compatible so files can be read and written by all of these
tools and by agents using the plugin's published format reference.
